Package: droidloom-base
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: EvilBorsch <44337169+EvilBorsch@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/denialwm/droidloom
Description: Android system partitions for Droidloom (AOSP 17 base)
 Read-only EROFS images of the AOSP Android 17 system, system_ext and product
 partitions (Android CI build CP2A.260605.016, aosp_cf_arm64_only_phone,
 64-bit only), mounted by Droidloom inside its Android cell. They change
 rarely, so this large package is downloaded again only when they do.
 .
 Repacked unchanged from the upstream Arch Linux ARM package
 droidloom-base @PKGVER@-@PKGREL@.
